1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
I recently handled a case

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,200
about toxic managers and employees.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,800
Let me share it now.

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,000
I am Dr. Hema Prasad, psychologist.

5
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,200
A young guy I know,

6
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,500
who is very smart,

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,500
landed an MNC job

8
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,000
at a very young age.

9
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
While working there,

10
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,500
his colleagues were much older.

11
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,500
They saw his good performance

12
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,500
and his regular salary hikes.

13
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,500
Compared to them,

14
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,500
he earned twice as much.

15
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,500
So they felt jealous

16
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:43,000
and constantly criticized him.

17
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,500
Because of that, he faced

18
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,500
vulgar language and abuse.

19
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:53,000
They treated him terribly,

20
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,500
pushing him into depression.

21
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:58,500
Later, he came to me.

22
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:42,000
When I analyzed the situation,

23
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,500
it was his environment.

24
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:48,500
He just wanted to work happily.

25
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:52,000
He was a knowledgeable person

26
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,500
who got along with everyone.

27
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:59,000
Their plot to kick him out

28
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:02,500
and their toxic mindset

29
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:06,500
deeply impacted his life.

